fight feels immersive, strategic, and unforgettable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/32e7b5a12db977d72c10b43a1e6afda1.poster.avif?t=1782465517\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/32e7b5a12db977d72c10b43a1e6afda1.webm?t=1782465517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/32e7b5a12db977d72c10b43a1e6afda1.mp4?t=1782465517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highly Diverse Siege Battles: The Ultimate Test of Strategy and Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in truly massive siege battles with thousands of troops clashing on-screen. Use trebuchets to shatter walls, deploy siege towers to breach ramparts, and lead armored infantry through kill zones in fierce close-quarters combat. Each battle unfolds in three tactical phases–siege preparation, front-line assault, and point conquest–mirroring authentic military strategy and testing your command at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/9d7c2c83604a57f00e048b92369014b0.poster.avif?t=1782465517\" width=426 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/9d7c2c83604a57f00e048b92369014b0.webm?t=1782465517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/9d7c2c83604a57f00e048b92369014b0.mp4?t=1782465517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Troops Command: A Tactical Symphony of History’s Finest</s